WEBVTT

00:00:57.428 --> 00:01:01.724
There is near unanimity
that being a long-term thinker --

00:01:01.724 --> 00:01:02.850
having perspective,

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.895
having the ability to think
and ask big questions --

00:01:05.895 --> 00:01:08.314
is essential to our success.

00:01:08.773 --> 00:01:10.650
And yet in a separate study,

00:01:10.650 --> 00:01:14.487
96 percent of leaders were surveyed,

00:01:14.487 --> 00:01:18.157
and they said they don’t have time
for strategic thinking.

00:01:18.157 --> 00:01:19.158
(Laughter)

00:01:19.367 --> 00:01:20.910
What is going on?

00:01:21.327 --> 00:01:22.328
Why is it --

00:01:22.328 --> 00:01:23.871
how can it be

00:01:23.871 --> 00:01:29.168
that 96 percent of people
are not doing the one thing

00:01:29.168 --> 00:01:32.922
that they say is most critical
to their success?